WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.263 --> 00:00:06.008
- What's up guys, it's Evan
coming to you from London.

00:00:06.008 --> 00:00:08.046
We are at Tower Bridge.

00:00:08.046 --> 00:00:09.849
I wanted to talk to you guys about my book

00:00:09.849 --> 00:00:12.249
and I want some feedback.

00:00:12.249 --> 00:00:13.416
So I'm launching a new book,

00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:15.427
it's going to be The
Top 10 Rules of Success.

00:00:15.427 --> 00:00:18.498
I'm taking the 50 most popular profiles

00:00:18.498 --> 00:00:19.952
that we've ever done on the channel,

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:21.601
the one's that have had the most views,

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:23.342
and I condense them down.

00:00:23.342 --> 00:00:27.509
So it's going to be a book
that has two rules per page.

00:00:28.593 --> 00:00:30.608
So if we're looking at
Richard Branson or Mark Cuban

00:00:30.608 --> 00:00:34.371
or Oprah Winfrey or any
of the big entrepreneurs

00:00:34.371 --> 00:00:37.167
and celebrities and people
that we've profiled.

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:39.894
Some of those videos can be long.

00:00:39.894 --> 00:00:42.757
Some of those videos can
be 20, 30, 40 minutes

00:00:42.757 --> 00:00:47.067
and so what I'm doing is
taking it to two rules per page

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:49.929
so you can get through
everything super quickly.

00:00:49.929 --> 00:00:52.761
The ideas, I wanted to be

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:55.228
something that you look at every morning

00:00:55.228 --> 00:00:57.680
but not something that you
read all the way through.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:59.329
Read one page.

00:00:59.329 --> 00:01:00.450
This is my thought.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.726
I want you to read one page per day.

00:01:01.726 --> 00:01:03.759
It's super easy to read one page per day.

00:01:03.759 --> 00:01:05.348
And then think about it.

00:01:05.348 --> 00:01:06.730
Think about the lesson
that you just learned

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:08.084
and then try to find some way to apply it

00:01:08.084 --> 00:01:10.210
to your life or to your business.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.243
The idea is if you read a page a day

00:01:13.243 --> 00:01:15.911
and thought about these great things

00:01:15.911 --> 00:01:17.544
that people are teaching you,

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.115
it changes your environment.

00:01:19.115 --> 00:01:21.686
It changes, hopefully,
your morning routine,

00:01:21.686 --> 00:01:23.032
your structure, what you think about.

00:01:23.032 --> 00:01:25.088
And what you surround
yourself with matters.

00:01:25.088 --> 00:01:28.734
If you are on a daily
basis feeding yourself

00:01:28.734 --> 00:01:30.641
with ideas from people
who have accomplished

00:01:30.641 --> 00:01:32.498
some of the greatest things in the world,

00:01:32.498 --> 00:01:35.780
you can't help but get greater yourself.

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:37.587
If you are surrounded by people that have

00:01:37.587 --> 00:01:39.334
big, bold, passionate ideas

00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:41.069
that they're off making a
huge change in the world,

00:01:41.069 --> 00:01:43.598
you can't help but be
a little bit more bold,

00:01:43.598 --> 00:01:45.328
little bit more courageous yourself.

00:01:45.328 --> 00:01:48.869
That was the idea behind making this book,

00:01:48.869 --> 00:01:51.372
behind the structure of
reading one page per day.

00:01:51.372 --> 00:01:52.876
I want your feedback.

00:01:52.876 --> 00:01:54.046
What do you think about the idea?

00:01:54.046 --> 00:01:56.550
Any thoughts, suggestions that you have

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.228
to make it better.

00:01:58.228 --> 00:02:00.010
The book is supposed
to come out December 6.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.717
That's at least my goal.

00:02:01.717 --> 00:02:05.137
It was December 6 that
I launched my last book

00:02:05.137 --> 00:02:06.365
and so

00:02:06.365 --> 00:02:09.215
I thought on the anniversary
of that thing coming out,

00:02:09.215 --> 00:02:11.807
Your One Word that I do the second book.

00:02:11.807 --> 00:02:14.349
So I'd love to get your support on that.

00:02:14.349 --> 00:02:16.434
One other thing that's in the book as well

00:02:16.434 --> 00:02:21.005
is I took the 10 most common
lessons that are in the book.

00:02:21.005 --> 00:02:25.207
So I basically, we have 50
entrepreneurs, 10 rules each.

00:02:25.207 --> 00:02:27.655
That's 500 different rules

00:02:27.655 --> 00:02:29.972
and took the most popular 10 that came up

00:02:29.972 --> 00:02:32.268
over and over and over
and over and over again.

00:02:32.268 --> 00:02:33.990
And that's something that you
guys have asked for a lot.

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.371
What are the most common rules?

00:02:35.371 --> 00:02:37.147
What are the ones that keep coming up?

00:02:37.147 --> 00:02:38.705
And so the book will actually lead

00:02:38.705 --> 00:02:40.534
with those 10 most common rules

00:02:40.534 --> 00:02:43.281
and then get into entrepreneur at a time,

00:02:43.281 --> 00:02:46.912
one entrepreneur at a time
with their top 10 rules.

00:02:46.912 --> 00:02:48.310
And so I want your feedback.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:49.443
What do you think of the idea?

00:02:49.443 --> 00:02:50.709
I want your suggestions.

00:02:50.709 --> 00:02:52.667
How can I make the book even
more awesome than it is?

00:02:52.667 --> 00:02:55.689
I'm going to be,
hopefully soon, getting my

00:02:55.689 --> 00:02:57.728
test audience of 30 people in Toronto

00:02:57.728 --> 00:03:00.059
to read through the actual
book and give me feedback.

00:03:00.059 --> 00:03:02.184
This one is actually
going to be self-published

00:03:02.184 --> 00:03:03.921
as opposed to Your One Word

00:03:03.921 --> 00:03:05.436
that I went with a major publisher

00:03:05.436 --> 00:03:07.781
so if you want to get
any answers to questions

00:03:07.781 --> 00:03:10.012
on the self-publishing
process, let me know.

00:03:10.012 --> 00:03:12.788
Just looking forward to your thoughts,

00:03:12.788 --> 00:03:14.270
suggestions, feedback, and support.

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:15.544
I really appreciate it.

00:03:15.544 --> 00:03:18.658
It's been on my mind as I
walk through London today.

00:03:18.658 --> 00:03:19.971
So looking forward to
hear what you have to say.

00:03:19.971 --> 00:03:21.392
Leave it down in the comments below.

00:03:21.392 --> 00:03:23.120
So thank you guys so much for watching.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:24.589
I believe in you.

00:03:24.589 --> 00:03:27.288
Hope we continue to believe in yourself

00:03:27.288 --> 00:03:31.076
and whatever Your One Word is, much love.

00:03:31.076 --> 00:03:32.159
See you soon.

